WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:09.890
Study grazing activity over a season. The showcase follows agricultural parcels northeast of Lund using a satellite time series.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:18.050
Agricultural parcel boundaries link vegetation observations to the areas being assessed.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:24.610
Seasonal changes in vegetation and water indices feed the grazing classifier.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:36.250
The configured example reports 68 active, 8 inactive and 4 without a valid classification. Confidence is not measured accuracy.
